{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:70e3fafeea062d4a","name":"T0-D Interrogation Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-70e3fafeea062d4a","title":"T0-D Interrogation Droid","revision":24444,"timestamp":"2024-11-02T20:20:58Z","sha256":"a84ffde91910f2a42df8ff6bb08e0e4717eb10d6a90f50d772bdd07726ff229c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24444","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=T0-D%20Interrogation%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-70e3fafeea062d4a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Sword of the Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sword_of_the_Empire","referenceId":"reference:56baf6e19ed21c48"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Security Bureau"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Security_Bureau","referenceId":"reference:6248e34cdab1a02e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most Droids capable of causing harm to organic creatures through their programming were outlawed after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," rose to power. Interrogation Droids remained legal and were primarily used as a tool of the Empire. In fact, their mere existence was not a well-kept secret. Rumors of their horrifying techniques and wicked cruelty spread throughout the Empire, and those citizens who were arrested by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Security Bureau"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Security_Bureau","referenceId":"reference:6248e34cdab1a02e"}," and survived the Droids' treatments can tell the tale of their sadistic actions.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["T0-D Interrogation Droid can't be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["T0-D Interrogation Droid Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Interrogation Droids are utilized almost exclusively by the Empire and other tyrannical governments. One group of Rebels witnessed Interrogation Droids patrolling a sensitive Imperial location and reported seeing the Droids firing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," bursts, but none of the Droids were captured to verify the finding. In fact, the ISB has used Interrogation Droids as lie detectors, looming next to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," interrogator and monitoring the prisoner's heart rate, muscle tension, and vocal patterns. Imperial interrogators have observed that the Droid's mere presence encourages people to cooperate and tell the truth, even if the Droid is not necessarily there to torture the detainee.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["On the rare occasion when an Interrogation Droid gets caught in the middle of a battle, it will do everything in its power to get out of the line of fire. It will defend itself if cornered, attempting to create a means of escape. Encounters with Interrogation Droids might also involve ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence Officers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence_Officers"}," or other military personnel.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["T0-D Interrogation Droid Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["1st-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://sw